    "Since splicing is allowed, is the goal simply to minimize the total area (square meters) of standard roll material consumed, or is there some other objective such as minimizing the number of standard rolls used?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy choice regarding the optimization objective (minimizing area vs. minimizing roll count), which constitutes one semantically independent question."
}

